 We recently did some work on loading/unloading in the dev version of devtools. Can you try again with the latest version?

Also, it's considered good practice to put this in your package (note that it will only work properly with the latest devtools):

.onUnload <- function(libpath) {
  library.dynam.unload("yourpackagename", libpath)
}

If you still have problems, could you share a minimal package that reproduces the problem?

-Winston

